      cff-version: 1.2.0
      message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
      title: "HPO Mapper: Automated Extraction of Human Phenotype Ontology Terms from Clinical Documentation"
      abstract: >-
        A HIPAA-compliant clinical tool that automatically extracts Human Phenotype Ontology (HPO) terms from unstructured medical documentation using large language models and vector-based semantic matching for standardized genetic analysis. Supports rare-disease variant prioritization and clinical decision support workflows.
